# =============================================================================
#  Credit–Equity Dislocation — public-repo ignore rules
#  Goal: publish code, methodology, presentation, and AGGREGATE outputs only.
#  Never publish WRDS-licensed data, credentials, caches, or local session files.
# =============================================================================

# ---- Credentials / secrets (NEVER commit) ----
.pgpass
*.pgpass
.env
*.env
.envrc
wrds_credentials*
.wrds
*secret*
*credentials*

# ---- WRDS-licensed data: raw, interim, processed, and all manifests ----
# Keep the folder placeholders so the structure is visible; ignore every dataset.
/data/raw/*
/data/interim/*
/data/processed/*
!/data/raw/.gitkeep
!/data/interim/.gitkeep
!/data/processed/.gitkeep
# belt-and-suspenders: never commit these dataset types anywhere
*.parquet
*.feather
*.h5
*.dta
*.sas7bdat

# ---- Firm-level / security-level licensed OUTPUTS (row-level WRDS observations) ----
# These CSVs/JSON contain per-firm-month returns + identifiers derived from WRDS.
/output/tables/current_snapshot_scores.csv
/output/tables/current_extremes_positive.csv
/output/tables/current_extremes_negative.csv
/output/tables/current_candidates.csv
/output/diagnostics/phase4_current_snapshot.json
# phase4_current_snapshot.md reproduces ~30 firm-month licensed returns inline (top/bottom
# extremes + candidate tables). Excluded by default; opt back in if comfortable — it is
# small/illustrative and the method is already in src/current_snapshot.py + the README.
/output/diagnostics/phase4_current_snapshot.md

# ---- Internal workflow / planning / session artifacts (not interviewer-facing) ----
# Safe content, but documents the working process rather than the research itself.
/CLAUDE.md
/RESEARCH_LOG.md
/output/diagnostics/phase5_storyboard.md
/output/diagnostics/phase4_trade_design.md
/output/diagnostics/phase4_event_check.md
/output/diagnostics/phase3_liquidity_plan.md
/output/diagnostics/phase3_rate_robustness_plan.md

# ---- Claude Code / agent session & local settings ----
.claude/
*.claude

